{"3587480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Underpacked!", "steam_appid": 3587480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/7ee6086cbec18be7ac61fb0d8c6621cb.avif?t=1784225897\" width=700 height=296 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Underpacked! you´ll have the best delivery crew at your side, but keep in mind you´ll never be alone. Play alone or with friends and enjoy both the chaotic journey and the joys of workplace exploitation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/cea82f7a136e81bdc59a0bb4387619c9.avif?t=1784225897\" width=800 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The whole galaxy is waiting for your deliveries! Assemble your orders so you can ship them across space. Pick them up and paint them to get them ready. Grab a package and customize it to match the recipient’s request and remember: every package matters and ink is to expensive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/c967932048ba808922ed373bfa6a20dd.poster.avif?t=1784225897\" width=700 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/c967932048ba808922ed373bfa6a20dd.webm?t=1784225897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/fccf3da8725138f7eccb41f6d8e80fe0.avif?t=1784225897\" width=800 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch out! Space is full of enemies, but don´t worry, your boss has given you just enough resources to protect yourselves. Load up the turret and shoot to defend the ship, but don´t forget: the package is what matters, and workers are replaceable.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/b44ba7385fa56fedcb09d2611dbd73e8.poster.avif?t=1784225897\" width=700 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/b44ba7385fa56fedcb09d2611dbd73e8.webm?t=1784225897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/0ffb40887ca131834cd6fb85e581396e.avif?t=1784225897\" width=800 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make sure you´ve got the right package ready to go. Load into the turret and launch it at the right target. Aim carefully, don't send it to the wrong galaxy, deliveries depend on you… and a bit of luck.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/0f6f2767a4972d27b6190845f97ccaa7.poster.avif?t=1784225897\" width=700 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steams